<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up versions of certain specials.</>
<#aab8c7>Use the normal motion, then press two buttons together.</>
Two Punch buttons		[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Two Kick buttons		[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Use the button type required by that move.</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves spend power; build meter before using them.</>
<#aab8c7>EX specials require 400 power.</>

<#f0f000>:Special Moves:</>
Hadouken                                        _D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
EX Hadouken                                     _D_DF_F_+[^X^Y/^Y^Z/^X^Z]
Shoryuken                                       _F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
EX Shoryuken                                    _F_D_DF_+[^X^Y/^Y^Z/^X^Z]
Tatsumaki Senpukkyaku                           _D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C]
EX Tatsumaki Senpukkyaku                        _D_DB_B_+[^A^B/^B^C/^A^C]
Air Tatsumaki Senpukkyaku                       _D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C] (Air)
Ryusenkyaku                                     _F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C]
Zenpou Tenshin                                  _F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]

